course: dictionary
lesson: 3856
title: Fourth: place in order and one of four equal parts
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «Fourth» has two jobs, and the words around it tell you which one. After «the», it means a place in order: the one after the third. «Three safe rides did not make the fourth one safe» means the fourth ride in the line.
explain: After «a» or a number, fourth means one of four equal parts. «One fourth of 20 is 20 ÷ 4 = 5» means that if you share 20 into four equal parts, each part is 5. A fourth is the same as a quarter.
explain: Check your meaning by swapping in a different word. In «one fourth of 20», try «one quarter of 20». If it still makes sense, you have the right meaning.
fact: A fourth is one of four equal parts, the same as a quarter.
fact: «The fourth» is the one after the third in order: first, second, third, fourth.
fact: Three fourths means three of the four equal parts.
fact: A half of 12 is 6, a third of 12 is 4, and a fourth of 12 is 3: the more parts you share into, the smaller each part.
fact: In the USA, «fourth grade» is a school year for children about 9 to 10 years old.
exercise: «Three safe rides did not make the fourth one safe.» In this sentence, what does fourth mean? | *The fourth ride in order | The first ride | The fastest ride | One of four equal parts
exercise: «One fourth of 20 is 20 ÷ 4 = 5.» What is one fourth of 20? | 10 | 4 | *5 | 16
exercise: Ella cuts a ribbon into four equal pieces. What is another word for one piece? | *A quarter | A fifth | A third | A tenth
test: «Three fourths of a ribbon is 18 cm.» How long is one fourth of the ribbon? | *6 cm | 9 cm | 24 cm | 4 cm
test: «If the first three marks add up to 228, the fourth must be 320 − 228 = 92.» In this sentence, what does fourth mean? | The first mark | *The fourth mark, in order, found by taking away the first three from the total | One of four equal parts of 320 | The fourth mark, in order
exam: A half of 12 is 6, a third of 12 is 4, and a fourth of 12 is what? | 2 | 4 | *3 | 6
